<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/harbor-boats.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/harbor-boats-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/harbor-boats.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Privacy Practices</span></nav><p class="kicker">Site information</p><h1>Privacy Practices</h1><p class="lede">What we collect on this site, how we use it, and your choices.</p></div></section><div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose narrow">
<p><em>Last updated: November 12, 2026</em></p>
<h2>What we collect</h2><p>When you send a form, call or email, we collect what you choose to give us, such as your name, phone, email, property location and details about your claim. Our web host also records standard technical data (IP address, browser type, pages requested) for security and performance.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2><ul><li>To respond to you and review your claim.</li><li>To provide services you ask for.</li><li>To keep the site secure and working.</li></ul>
<p>We don’t sell personal information. We share it only with people who need it to help with your claim (with your permission), with providers who host our site and email, or when the law requires it.</p>
<h2>Claim tools</h2><p>Our calculators and checks run in your browser. What you type into them isn’t sent to us or stored on our servers.</p>
<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This site doesn’t set advertising cookies. Fonts load from Google Fonts, which may log standard request data under Google’s privacy policy. If we add website analytics, it will be used in aggregate to understand which pages help visitors.</p>
<h2>Text messages</h2><p>If you agree to be contacted by text, message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out at any time.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete the information you’ve given us by emailing <a href="mailto:info@maineinsuranceappraiser.com">info@maineinsuranceappraiser.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Maine Insurance Appraiser · <a href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a> · <a href="mailto:info@maineinsuranceappraiser.com">info@maineinsuranceappraiser.com</a></p></article><aside class="aside"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Free first conversation</h2><p>We’ll look at the carrier’s estimate and tell you plainly whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="big-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-coral full" href="/reach-us/">Send claim details</a></div></aside></div>
